{
  "canvasId": "c8d5f7a2-3e1b-4d9f-a6c8-7b2e5d4f1a3c",
  "createdAt": "2026-04-30T12:00:00.000Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-04-30T10:20:58.821Z",
  "defaultViewport": {
    "x": 40,
    "y": 30,
    "z": 0.55
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ob-title",
      "x": 100,
      "y": 80,
      "width": 1212.9427911718267,
      "height": 87.13729796372016,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "A spatial workspace for files, notes, links, and boards.\n\n\nLocal-first. File-first. Made to organize, not just collect."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-hint-pan",
      "x": 414.4293417530773,
      "y": 227.25199956254775,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 130,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "How to look around\nThe board you are seeing is read-only. Use the hand tool to pan, and scroll to zoom. To actually edit anything, click 'Open the full board' below the preview."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-concept-boards",
      "x": 572.1084208673842,
      "y": 584.6236788877618,
      "width": 274.9482041003296,
      "height": 154.38031091688032,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "A board is a flat .canvas file. It maps a topic spatially. Use it for orientation, grouping, and quick navigation between things you actually care about."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-concept-markdown",
      "x": 1380.4078571868208,
      "y": 779.4071682636963,
      "width": 285,
      "height": 200,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Markdown holds the longer thinking. Notes, specs, and decisions live in .md files and render right on the board, no separate doc app needed."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-concept-bases",
      "x": 2177.968026437905,
      "y": 775.3903218331801,
      "width": 285,
      "height": 200,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Bases\nBases query files, notes, and projects, then sort and filter them. They are the stable, structured layer behind the spatial board."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-concept-embeds",
      "x": 3070.921296952538,
      "y": 737.37827246159,
      "width": 285,
      "height": 200,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Embeds\nLinks, PDFs, images, even other apps can live on the board. Previews load by default. Switch to live mode when the motion earns its place."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-section-blocks",
      "x": 2049.3063146357663,
      "y": 1623.5647896438034,
      "width": 1237.3821904810688,
      "height": 76.15153394888515,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Building blocks\nEvery item in this row is a real, working node. Open the full board to drag, edit, or replace any of them."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-demo-text",
      "x": 2046.740670601689,
      "y": 1723.5647896438036,
      "width": 300,
      "height": 320,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Text node\nThis is a plain text node. Click it in the editor to type. The first line works as your heading by convention. Use it for short labels and one-liners."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-demo-link",
      "x": 2366.74067060169,
      "y": 1723.5647896438036,
      "width": 321.6276223026923,
      "height": 312.76810284139697,
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://github.com/evrenucar/proto_website",
      "title": "Link node",
      "description": "Bookmarks come with a thumbnail and a description. Toggle to live mode to load the page inline.",
      "embedMode": "preview"
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-demo-markdown",
      "x": 2706.74067060169,
      "y": 1720.9991456097273,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 320,
      "type": "markdown",
      "file": "/content/boards/onboarding/onboarding-markdown-demo.md",
      "href": "/content/boards/onboarding/onboarding-markdown-demo.md",
      "title": "Markdown node",
      "_rawMarkdown": "# Markdown node\n\nMarkdown nodes render real `.md` files inline on the board.\n\n- Headings, lists, and links work as you would expect\n- The file lives on disk at the path the node points to\n- Editing here saves back to that same file\n\nOpen the [Cosmoboard direction note](/content/boards/cosmoboard/direction.md) for a longer example.\n",
      "markdownId": "cosmo-note-9e3vznxslog",
      "markdownUpdatedAt": "2026-04-30T09:04:54.932Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-demo-image",
      "x": 3046.740670601691,
      "y": 1723.5647896438036,
      "width": 240,
      "height": 320,
      "type": "file",
      "file": "/content/boards/cosmoboard/screenshot-4.png",
      "hasAdjustedRatio": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-section-edit",
      "x": 2071.8556691767576,
      "y": 2389.608239972937,
      "width": 1224.698376620758,
      "height": 74.09639315234988,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "How to edit\nThe toolbar lives at the bottom right of the full board. Most actions also have keyboard shortcuts."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-edit-toolbar",
      "x": 2071.8556691767576,
      "y": 2489.608239972937,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Toolbar and shortcuts\nV select. Space pan. T add text. P pen. L add link. X new markdown.\nCtrl+S save. Ctrl+O open canvas. Ctrl+I import."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-edit-import",
      "x": 2491.8556691767562,
      "y": 2489.608239972937,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Drag and drop\nDrop images, PDFs, .md, or .txt files straight onto the board. They land where you drop them and become real nodes you can move around."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-edit-save",
      "x": 2911.8556691767562,
      "y": 2489.608239972937,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 260,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Saving\nThe board autosaves to your browser every 20 seconds. Ctrl+S writes the .canvas file to disk when running locally. Export bundles the board as a portable .zip."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-section-base",
      "x": 2081.0438878339114,
      "y": 3092.8360161912124,
      "width": 1224.246788532711,
      "height": 74.27799784942275,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Structured data with bases\nA base reads a JSON file and shows it as a sortable, filterable table right on the board."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-projects-base",
      "x": 2081.0438878339114,
      "y": 3190.92868214102,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 380,
      "type": "base",
      "source": "/content/base-data/items.json",
      "collection": "",
      "filter": "section=projects",
      "columns": [
        "title",
        "publishingStatus",
        "year",
        "effort"
      ],
      "title": "Projects"
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-base-explainer",
      "x": 2821.043887833911,
      "y": 3192.8360161912124,
      "width": 500,
      "height": 380,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "What you are looking at\nThis is a live base node, reading from /content/base-data/items.json. Edit the JSON file, refresh, and the table updates. Bases stay portable: the data is just a file."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-section-app",
      "x": 2081.0438878339114,
      "y": 3652.8360161912124,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Apps inside boards\nWeb apps can sit on the board as preview tiles or live embeds. Sessions persist in the .canvas alongside the rest."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-app-excalidraw",
      "x": 2081.0438878339114,
      "y": 3752.8360161912124,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 300,
      "type": "app",
      "source": "/content/apps/excalidraw-proto.json",
      "embedMode": "preview",
      "appConfig": {
        "slug": "excalidraw-proto",
        "appName": "Excalidraw",
        "description": "A quick scratchpad session for wireframes.",
        "url": "https://excalidraw.com/#room=aa8b4c2b9213123b320d,4RkR000000000000000000",
        "icon": "✏️",
        "tags": [
          "sketch",
          "ui"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-app-explainer",
      "x": 2481.043887833911,
      "y": 3752.8360161912124,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 300,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "How app nodes work\nThis tile previews an Excalidraw session. Click it in the full editor to open the live embed. The session URL is part of the .canvas, so closing the page keeps your work."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-section-nested",
      "x": 2081.0438878339114,
      "y": 4092.836016191213,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Boards inside boards\nAny board can hold a preview of another board. Click the preview to navigate."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-braindump",
      "x": 2081.0438878339114,
      "y": 4192.836016191212,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 260,
      "type": "board-preview",
      "boardSlug": "braindump",
      "boardSource": "/boards/cosmo-braindump_current.canvas",
      "boardHref": "/braindump.html",
      "title": "Braindump",
      "description": "A linked board preview. Open the broader freeform board when you want the wider working surface."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-nested-explainer",
      "x": 2421.043887833911,
      "y": 4192.836016191212,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 320,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Why nest boards\nOne board cannot hold every project. A board-preview node is a live minimap that links to another .canvas file. Use it to break a big workspace into smaller, named boards without losing the overview."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-section-feedback",
      "x": 2081.0438878339114,
      "y": 4552.836016191212,
      "width": 900,
      "height": 80,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Save, share, send feedback\nThree buttons in the full board's toolbar open prefilled GitHub issues. No sign-up beyond GitHub itself."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-feedback-recommend",
      "x": 2081.0438878339114,
      "y": 4652.836016191212,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 240,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Recommend\nUse this when you want to send a board you would like to see live. The current canvas attaches automatically."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-feedback-feature",
      "x": 2501.043887833911,
      "y": 4652.836016191212,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 240,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Feature request\nUse this when you want something Cosmoboard does not do yet. Describe the use case, not the implementation."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-feedback-bug",
      "x": 2921.043887833911,
      "y": 4652.836016191212,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 240,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Bug report\nUse this when something broke. The board file goes along with the issue so the state is reproducible."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-close-fullboard",
      "x": 2081.0438878339114,
      "y": 4952.8360161912115,
      "width": 440,
      "height": 200,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Open the full board\nReady to actually try it? Click 'Open the full board' under the landing preview, or jump straight to the editor page."
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-github",
      "x": 2541.043887833911,
      "y": 4952.8360161912115,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 200,
      "type": "link",
      "url": "https://github.com/evrenucar/proto_website",
      "title": "GitHub repo",
      "description": "Source, issues, pull requests.",
      "embedMode": "preview"
    },
    {
      "id": "ob-direction-md",
      "x": 2941.043887833911,
